Package: gganimslide
Type: Package
Title: Reveal 'ggplot2' Layers Step by Step in 'PowerPoint' and
        'Beamer' Slides
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Joël Frédéric", "Lattmann", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "jlattmann@student.ethz.ch")
Description: Turns a saved 'ggplot2' object into an animated slide in which
    plot layers appear one after another. ggppt() writes a 'PowerPoint' slide
    with one editable vector shape per step and native entrance animations;
    ggtex() writes a multi-page PDF plus 'LaTeX' 'beamer' overlay code. All
    steps are cut from one rendered plot, so axes and layers never shift
    between steps.
