Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), grDevices, grid, officer (>= 0.6.2), rvg
        (>= 0.3.0), xml2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
